      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we\u0027re willing to require callers to pass \"--dist\u003dtrue\" are we willing to require them to pass the more explicit \"--log-dir\u003d$DIST_DIR\"?\n\nWe\u0027re expecting that multiproduct_kati is only ever used for testing, right? What situations are there where we\u0027d expect a user to want to specify \"--dist\u003dtrue\" or \"--dist\u003dfalse\"?",
      "revId": "5a76aa22aabbc4ca8cecbb6ee51a122ea9528ad0",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
